# =====================================================================
# TEMPORARY - FAKE drawbar clamp sensors, for AIR SWAPS ONLY.
# =====================================================================
# The real clamp/unclamp sensor bracket (7i70 input-18 / input-19) is off
# for repairs (2026-10-14), so the atc would time out at step 30.  This
# makes the atc see the drawbar do whatever the unclamp output tells it,
# instantly:
#     unclamp output ON  -> unclamped TRUE,  clamped FALSE
#     unclamp output OFF -> unclamped FALSE, clamped TRUE
#
# NEVER run this with tools in the machine - the atc would pull a tool
# without knowing the drawbar really let go / really gripped.
# To remove: delete the HALFILE = sim_clamp_sensors.hal line in the ini.

unlinkp atc.0.tool-clamped
unlinkp atc.0.tool-unclamped

loadrt not names=clamp-sim-not
addf clamp-sim-not servo-thread

net spindle-tool-unclamp  =>  atc.0.tool-unclamped  clamp-sim-not.in
net clamp-sim-clamped     clamp-sim-not.out  =>  atc.0.tool-clamped
